 "sentences": [
  "Parts of the Atacama Desert just turned white.",
  "Back-to-back winter storms in August 2026 brought rare snowfall to this usually arid region.",
  "The snow stretched from the Andes all the way to the Pacific coast.",
  "High winds even forced the ALMA radio telescope array to suspend operations.",
  "One coastal town received 10 times its annual rainfall in just 3 days.",
  "This wild weather shift was fueled by a strengthening El Niño."
